{
  "schema": "cablesim.plugin/2",
  "id": "cablesim.simulation",
  "version": "0.4.0",
  "name": "仿真复现基准",
  "description": "多区域稳态导热与GetDP时谐涡流、Elmer稳态/瞬态热适配，使用统一问题、网格和复现工件。",
  "icon": "assets/icon.svg",
  "publisher": {
    "id": "cablesim",
    "name": "CableSimPro"
  },
  "host_api": {
    "major": 2,
    "min_minor": 1
  },
  "license": {
    "spdx": "LicenseRef-Project-Undeclared",
    "review_required": true
  },
  "platforms": [
    "windows-x64",
    "linux-x64"
  ],
  "runtime": {
    "kind": "python",
    "python": ">=3.11,<3.14",
    "entry": "src/cablesim_simulation/main.py"
  },
  "permissions": [
    "project.read",
    "study.run",
    "artifact.write"
  ],
  "dependencies": [],
  "resources": {
    "timeout_s": 3600,
    "memory_mb": 4096,
    "network": "none"
  },
  "capabilities": [
    {
      "kind": "method",
      "id": "thermal-dataset",
      "title": "稳态热场与允许电流数据样本",
      "method_version": "thermal-dataset/0.1.0",
      "analysis": "steady_state",
      "input_schema": "cablesim.thermal-model/1",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "key": "conductor_temperature",
          "type": "quantity",
          "per": "cable",
          "required": true
        },
        {
          "key": "ampacity",
          "type": "quantity",
          "per": "circuit",
          "required": true
        }
      ],
      "artifacts": [
        {
          "type": "x-cablesim.dataset-sample",
          "required": true
        }
      ],
      "validation": {
        "level": "reference-benchmark",
        "cases": [
          "radial heat and resistive current hand solution; mesh refinement; same input on local and Slurm"
        ]
      },
      "limitations": [
        "计算范围继承多区域二维热场；显式保存运行点、指定回路额定电流、三档以上网格和收敛判定。",
        "其他回路保持保存负荷；未做计算域敏感性或物理模型认证；未收敛样本保留但不进入有效标签。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "method",
      "id": "contact-electrothermal-field",
      "title": "完整接触热域双向电热耦合",
      "method_version": "contact-electrothermal-field/0.1.0",
      "analysis": "steady_state",
      "input_schema": "cablesim.contact-electrothermal-field/1",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "key": "x-cablesim.maximum-temperature",
          "type": "quantity",
          "per": "section",
          "required": true
        }
      ],
      "artifacts": [
        {
          "type": "x-cablesim.simulation-bundle",
          "required": true
        },
        {
          "type": "x-cablesim.temperature-field",
          "required": true
        }
      ],
      "validation": {
        "level": "reference-benchmark",
        "cases": [
          "COMSOL06 independent Gmsh full geometry and bidirectional GetDP/contact thermal feedback"
        ]
      },
      "limitations": [
        "显式SI网格、温变电阻率和热导率、内部接触热阻及等幅给定电流源；外磁边界A=0，热外边界给定温度。",
        "均质绕组的平均端口Rac(T)必须有来源，含无源区域损耗；不外推材料温区，不替代IEC公式或真实三维绞合。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "method",
      "id": "terminal-field",
      "title": "多端子三相截面电容场",
      "method_version": "terminal-field/0.1.0",
      "analysis": "frequency_domain",
      "input_schema": "cablesim.terminal-field/1",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "key": "x-cablesim.terminal-capacitance",
          "type": "quantity",
          "per": "cable",
          "required": true
        }
      ],
      "artifacts": [
        {
          "type": "x-cablesim.simulation-bundle",
          "required": true
        }
      ],
      "validation": {
        "level": "reference-benchmark",
        "cases": [
          "Parallel-plate complex admittance; COMSOL02 six-terminal full geometry; tests/test_triangular_fields.py"
        ]
      },
      "limitations": [
        "显式来源的SI三角网格、各向同性sigma/epsilon、等电势端子和接地边界；P1复电势场。",
        "输出完整单位长度Y/C矩阵；不含磁感应与三维端部。网格生成来源须单独注明。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "method",
      "id": "contact-thermal-field",
      "title": "完整热域与薄层接触热阻",
      "method_version": "contact-thermal-field/0.1.0",
      "analysis": "steady_state",
      "input_schema": "cablesim.contact-thermal-field/1",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "key": "x-cablesim.maximum-temperature",
          "type": "quantity",
          "per": "section",
          "required": true
        }
      ],
      "artifacts": [
        {
          "type": "x-cablesim.simulation-bundle",
          "required": true
        },
        {
          "type": "x-cablesim.temperature-field",
          "required": true
        }
      ],
      "validation": {
        "level": "reference-benchmark",
        "cases": [
          "Two-slab temperature jump and heat balance; COMSOL06 full thermal geometry; tests/test_triangular_fields.py"
        ]
      },
      "limitations": [
        "显式来源的SI三角网格与体热源、有限温区k(T)多项式、给定温度外边界及内部零厚度接触热阻；不收敛或越界拒绝。",
        "不含暂态、对流流场、接触层面内传热或双向电磁热耦合；接触界面两侧温度独立导出。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "method",
      "id": "electrothermal",
      "title": "GetDP 电磁与温度场耦合",
      "method_version": "electrothermal/0.1.0",
      "analysis": "steady_state",
      "input_schema": "cablesim.electrothermal/1",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "key": "x-cablesim.maximum-temperature",
          "type": "quantity",
          "per": "section",
          "required": true
        }
      ],
      "artifacts": [
        {
          "type": "x-cablesim.simulation-bundle",
          "required": true
        },
        {
          "type": "x-cablesim.temperature-field",
          "required": true
        }
      ],
      "validation": {
        "level": "reference-benchmark",
        "cases": [
          "Coaxial sigma(T) feedback versus native COMSOL FrequencyStationary; plugin-tests/test_simulation_coupled.py"
        ]
      },
      "limitations": [
        "二维P1磁准静态与稳态导热；点式sigma(T)，固定k/mu，必须给出全部导电材料的温度有效区间。",
        "不含薄层接触热阻、暂态、介电热源、端部和完整COMSOL06多区域模型；不收敛或越界明确拒绝。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "method",
      "id": "capacitive-cable",
      "title": "同轴电缆频域电流与电容效应",
      "method_version": "capacitive-cable/0.1.0",
      "analysis": "frequency_domain",
      "input_schema": "cablesim.capacitive-cable/1",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "key": "x-cablesim.dielectric-screen-loss",
          "type": "quantity",
          "per": "cable",
          "required": true
        }
      ],
      "artifacts": [
        {
          "type": "x-cablesim.simulation-bundle",
          "required": true
        }
      ],
      "validation": {
        "level": "reference-benchmark",
        "cases": [
          "COMSOL submarine02 radial capacitance submodel and submarine03 axisymmetric bonding; plugin-tests/test_simulation_capacitive.py"
        ]
      },
      "limitations": [
        "同轴层状轴对称P1频域电流场，显式sigma/epsilon及峰值相量；含单点、两端和三段交叉互联，护套连续。",
        "不包含三相截面互电容、磁感应或铠装；COMSOL03的各向异性数值材料需显式输入，不冒充各向同性实物。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "method",
      "id": "getdp-eddy",
      "title": "GetDP 二维时谐涡流",
      "method_version": "getdp-eddy/0.1.0",
      "analysis": "frequency_domain",
      "input_schema": "cablesim.simulation-problem/1",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "key": "x-cablesim.joule-loss",
          "type": "quantity",
          "per": "cable",
          "required": true
        }
      ],
      "artifacts": [
        {
          "type": "x-cablesim.simulation-bundle",
          "required": true
        },
        {
          "type": "x-cablesim.reproduction-report",
          "required": true
        },
        {
          "type": "x-cablesim.loss-coefficients",
          "required": false
        }
      ],
      "validation": {
        "level": "reference-benchmark",
        "cases": [
          "E05平排护套GetDP场路联立；E17双线电阻；E18被动导体表面涡流；V01圆柱Bessel校核；见docs/plugins/SIMULATION.md与plugin-tests/test_simulation_external.py"
        ]
      },
      "limitations": [
        "需要独立安装GetDP3.5.0；启动前检测，缺失或版本不符明确失败。外部程序不随插件分发。",
        "二维无限长磁准静态Az-u联立，RMS相量、恒定各向同性sigma/mu，显式区域电流/电压和理想浮置互联组；无位移电流、铁磁非线性、端部或接地电阻网络。",
        "领域映射仅实心圆单芯及明确光滑同心层；参数更复杂时使用完整问题描述；有限外边界须单独核验域收敛。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "method",
      "id": "elmer-heat",
      "title": "Elmer 稳态与瞬态热场",
      "method_version": "elmer-heat/0.1.0",
      "analysis": "transient",
      "input_schema": "cablesim.simulation-problem/1",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "key": "x-cablesim.maximum-temperature",
          "type": "quantity",
          "per": "section",
          "required": true
        }
      ],
      "artifacts": [
        {
          "type": "x-cablesim.simulation-bundle",
          "required": true
        },
        {
          "type": "x-cablesim.reproduction-report",
          "required": true
        },
        {
          "type": "x-cablesim.temperature-field",
          "required": true
        }
      ],
      "validation": {
        "level": "analytic-benchmark",
        "cases": [
          "V02平板Fourier阶跃/周期及时步校核；E03干湿土同网格scikit-fem交叉校核；见plugin-tests/test_simulation_external.py；未完成IEC60853认证"
        ]
      },
      "limitations": [
        "需要官方26.1 Windows运行环境，其Solver报告9.0/Compiled2026-01-20；缺环境不退化到scikit-fem。",
        "常热导率与体积热容、固定或阶跃每米热源、均匀初温、Dirichlet/Robin/绝热；BDF1/2。未接入辐射、温变电阻或温变热物性。",
        "与已有热模型交叉校核复用同一网格；给定芯温内孔和固定热源可用。瞬态必须显式给出每区体积热容、初态、时步和负荷表。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "method",
      "id": "multiregion-thermal",
      "title": "多区域二维稳态热场",
      "method_version": "multiregion-thermal/0.1.0",
      "analysis": "steady_state",
      "input_schema": "cablesim.thermal-model/1",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "key": "conductor_temperature",
          "type": "quantity",
          "per": "cable",
          "required": true
        },
        {
          "key": "ampacity",
          "type": "quantity",
          "per": "circuit",
          "required": false
        }
      ],
      "artifacts": [
        {
          "type": "x-cablesim.simulation-bundle",
          "required": true
        },
        {
          "type": "x-cablesim.reproduction-report",
          "required": true
        },
        {
          "type": "x-cablesim.temperature-field",
          "required": true
        }
      ],
      "validation": {
        "level": "unverified",
        "cases": []
      },
      "limitations": [
        "二维轴向无限长、1至64根有正间隙同心圆缆、常热导率、矩形回填与分层土壤；不支持相切接触、非圆、多芯或湿迁移。",
        "显式热模型或SI领域文档走同一准备与求解入口；导体按面积平均温度修正电阻，交流/护套附加系数须有来源。",
        "管内空气使用显式IEC参考热阻换算的固定等效导热率；不求流体，不自动复制IEC公式或推导缺失损耗。",
        "温限电流反求只改变选定回路、保持其他负荷；全部电缆温限均参与约束。辐射仅为对给定环境的局部交换，不含互相遮挡。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "method",
      "id": "insulated-wire",
      "title": "绝缘导线导热基准",
      "method_version": "insulated-wire/0.1.0",
      "analysis": "steady_state",
      "input_schema": "cablesim.insulated-wire/1",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "key": "conductor_temperature",
          "type": "quantity",
          "per": "cable",
          "required": true
        }
      ],
      "artifacts": [
        {
          "type": "x-cablesim.simulation-bundle",
          "required": true
        }
      ],
      "validation": {
        "level": "analytic-benchmark",
        "cases": [
          "B01: scikit-fem 12.0.2 ex17; plugin-tests/test_simulation.py"
        ]
      },
      "limitations": [
        "仅支持单根同心双材料圆柱、常物性、导体均匀体热源和外表给定对流系数。",
        "显式参数输入；尚未接入领域文档或几何插件工件，不支持三相敷设、IEC 载流量、电磁损耗、暂态或 CFD。",
        "温度输出为导体中心插值；公开教学基准验证不等于厂家电缆或标准合规验证。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "method",
      "id": "solid-bonding-flat",
      "title": "平排护套回路论文校核",
      "method_version": "solid-bonding-flat/0.1.0",
      "analysis": "crosscheck",
      "input_schema": "cablesim.solid-bonding-flat/1",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "key": "x-cablesim.sheath-current",
          "type": "quantity",
          "per": "cable",
          "required": true
        }
      ],
      "artifacts": [
        {
          "type": "x-cablesim.simulation-bundle",
          "required": true
        }
      ],
      "validation": {
        "level": "reference-benchmark",
        "cases": [
          "E05: Lunca 2023 Table 3 analytic submodel versus FEM; tests/test_simulation_paper.py"
        ]
      },
      "limitations": [
        "仅三根相同平排电缆、平衡RMS电流、相同护套电阻、理想两端互联且合计护套电流为零。",
        "线电流与集总护套回路解析子模型，忽略局部涡流和地返回电流，不是谐波电磁FEM或完整论文复现。",
        "显式物理输入，不接受领域文档；单点接地、交叉互联、铠装或电热反馈尚未实现。"
      ]
    }
  ],
